@@ -3,3 +3,19 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory rental service:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` — `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`; `dailyPrice` is an integer
+  number of euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` — returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` — returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+
+`start` and `end` are ISO-8601 UTC times (ending in `Z`) at midnight; `end` is the start of the day after
+the last rented day. Both calls throw for an unknown item or a period that is not whole days, and `book`
+also throws when the item is already booked for any part of the period. Times are returned in the
+canonical form `YYYY-MM-DDT00:00:00.000Z`. Cancellations and refunds are not implemented yet.
+
+Run the tests with `npm test`.
